      "uid": "zhcn:971f6e1eb6e68718ac3be7d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "环顾四周，能在远处的树荫下，\n看到自动售货机微弱的光亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54bc86460cca1e2236170c5c087e3717d612746cbb3d4c345fde6a59d089c5d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
