      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "882b871b451bb344f472368b77ea4f0a3d543b47e3ddec20d4d572d59d51a0ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a125a1123b9eb0afbc3bff5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "距离日出应该还要一段时间。\n不能让她弄坏了身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f3315d07941cc441e150d5a66df337c6001483f1d44330d846138213a4a0bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62d7c541647f8859529a35e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "带着她走向停车场并催促她后，\n她终于满含歉意地答应了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ae2b697155264eaff2ba44d2b6cd13d95ba635a2747c88cfb51a55ec59f4bff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
