      "uid": "zhcn:572c352ac0b0bbc6a38df18b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次，也是为了这个目的，\n她才会将目标定在『天皇赏（春）』上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d139284d1b38847a7c1bec20477b8b24171fc2c0bb90e0bd0aa0b41b38b21cb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
