    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de51fb5dd5909cf1e8bbd2e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为走后冠路线的赛马娘来说，虽说\n耐力还算充足，但在最长距离的GⅠ赛事\n中可就完全是另一码事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8873b82087b350a99ef7a8e9735a26d15808253dd9dff739c38429383afa81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
