    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdb807655fa3aa846f4d225",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……。今年的春天，希望能将那朵特别的花，\n亲手摘下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4923ea2597033b74d7a84ae3b71e4cab47268ac3aedda5ba7af980fb6ad902e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1018b8bc9c87acd94b2e98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望金花能在『天皇赏（春）』上闪耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbf8f447ef6ee921c9b691d1e52bc1bb7d2aac56d8877f5ec8587dcb1ec7f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
